1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,150
Shaun. Listen to me. Get up.

2
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:14,880
You have to reach it. Before he does.

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,610
Every credit asks for something back.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,075
Too close. Too close.

5
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,650
Let your eyes settle before your feet move.

6
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,870
They're climbing out!

7
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,500
There he is. Still holding what you came for.

8
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,840
This is your last chance. Do you understand?
